      "text": "+----------------------------------+-------------------------+\n| Feature                          | Description             |\n|----------------------------------|-------------------------|\n| ° Number of Children             | Number of dependents    |\n| ° Total Income                   | Annual income           |\n| ° Number of Total Family Members | Household size          |\n| ° **Is Male-Identifying?**       | **Protected attribute** |\n| ° Owns Car?                      | Vehicle ownership       |\n| ° Owns Realty?                   | Property ownership      |\n| ° Is Partnered?                  | Relationship status     |\n| ° Is Employed?                   | Employment status       |\n| ° Lives with Parents?            | Living arrangement      |\n| ° Age (in days)                  | Applicant age           |\n| ° Length of Employment (in days) | Job tenure              |\n+----------------------------------+-------------------------+",
