      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[student@workstation ~]$ oc login -u admin -p redhatocp https://api.lab.example.com:6443\nLogin successful.\n\nYou have access to 85 projects, the list has been suppressed. You can list all projects with 'oc projects'\n\nUsing project \"monitoring-bias\".\n\nNAME                      DATA   AGE\ninferenceservice-config   17     30d\n[student@workstation ~]$ oc get cm/inferenceservice-config -n redhat-ods-applications > inferenceservice-config.yaml",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[student@workstation ~]$ oc login -u admin -p redhatocp https://api.lab.example.com:6443\nLogin successful.\n\nYou have access to 85 projects, the list has been suppressed. You can list all projects with 'oc projects'\n\nUsing project \"monitoring-bias\".\n\nNAME                      DATA   AGE\ninferenceservice-config   17     30d\n[student@workstation ~]$ oc get cm/inferenceservice-config -n redhat-ods-applications > inferenceservice-config.yaml",
